        'Al Jazeera quotes Rubio in Uzbekistan: "There has been no pause", and Zelensky, like the US, should focus on ending the war.',
        [(13056, 'There has been no pause'),
         (13056, 'What [Zelenskyy] should be focused on and what we want to be focused on is bringing an end to this war.')])
    c['diverge'] += ' Слова о Донбассе как причине продолжения конфликта в выборке передает только ТАСС.'
